# Mobile setup QR (Hub Settings)

Arrs Hub Mobile pairs with **one QR** that includes:

1. Hub base URL  
2. Photo dump key (`X-Arrs-Hub-Key`)  
3. Hub API token (`X-Arrs-Hub-Token`) — optional in the wire format, include whenever set  

URI: `arrs-hub-photo-dump://v1?url=…&key=…&token=…`

## UX rules when changing auth / photo dump

- Keep a **visible QR** under Settings → Photo dump / Mobile setup (not only after “Generate key”).
- Put a short callout: this QR covers **both** secrets; Hub API token section has **no** separate QR.
- Localhost `GET /api/photo-dump/setup-qr` builds the payload without rotating secrets.
- Regenerating the Hub token → user must **Refresh QR** (say so in the Hub token UI).
- Do not require `token` for photo-dump upload routes; do not merge the two secrets server-side.
